# Byte-exact integrity is a hard requirement of this project.
#
# Git's default line-ending normalisation would rewrite the CRLF experiment CSVs
# to LF on commit, altering file bytes. So: no text conversion, anywhere, for
# any file.
* -text

# Explicit for clarity
*.csv  -text
*.svg  -text
*.dot  -text
*.py   -text
*.md   -text
*.txt  -text
